Experimental support for Pascal (Delphi / Free Pascal): `languages: [pascal]`
(aliases `delphi`, `objectpascal`) for .pas, .dpr, .dpk and .lpr files.
Conditional compilation ({$IFDEF}, {$IF}, {$ELSE}...) is resolved before
parsing against a default Delphi/Win32 define set, configurable with the
SEMGREP_PASCAL_DEFINES environment variable. Identifiers are matched
case-insensitively.
